<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Your post is live</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #202124; background: #f4f0e8; padding: 32px;">
    <div style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fffdf9; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px;">
        <h1 style="margin-top: 0;">Nice work, {{ name }}!</h1>
        <p>Your post &ldquo;{{ title }}&rdquo; just went live.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <a href="{{ post_url }}" style="display: inline-block; background: #f4513d; color: #fffdf9; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">View your post &rarr;</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
